# Mock-a-Rita

Based on [a post by jesskeys](https://www.instagram.com/jesskeys_) (wayback unavailable)

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 sprigs [mint]{ ing="mint" }
- [ ] 1 oz [lime juice]{ ing="lime-juice" }
- [ ] 0-2 tsp [simple syrup]{ ing="simple-syrup" }
- [ ] 2 oz [Coconut cream]{ ing="coconut-cream" }
- [ ] 2 oz [Coconut water]{ ing="coconut-water" } (_or silver rum_)
- [ ] [club soda]{ ing="club-soda" } (added after shaking)

## Recipe

1. Shake vigorously and top with [club soda]{ ing="club-soda" }

## Notes

1. Swap Coconut water with silver rum to make alcoholic
